    "body": "I think we might need to start thinking about this again given the recent rulings by the [Austrian](https://noyb.eu/en/austrian-dsb-eu-us-data-transfers-google-analytics-illegal) and [French](https://noyb.eu/en/update-cnil-decides-eu-us-data-transfer-google-analytics-illegal#:~:text=Max%20Schrems%2C%20honorary%20chair%20of,other%20authorities%20will%20decide%20similarily.%22) data protection agencies that it is illegal for Austrian and French websites to use Google Analytics",
